	every time the Troll `comes back from the dead' the player is 
	charged 6 zorkmids.

	Also, and praying while on top of an altar to a god of a different
	alignment gives some truly weird results.

	Why do priests of an opposing alignment happily stand by while
	you appropriate their altar for your deity? 

